<title>USA: General Signal Corp Q4 shr $0.78 vs $0.41.</title>
<headline>General Signal Corp Q4 shr $0.78 vs $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions except per-share data)</p>
<p>				    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					 December 31,</p>
<p>					 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net sales			 $546.7	 $501.6</p>
<p> Cost of sales		    370.8	  348.9</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses     107.3	  101.4</p>
