<p> Average common shrs outstanding 50.0	 49.3</p>
<p>Note: (1) Represents $0.17 per share of transaction and consolidation charges related to the merger with Data Switch Corporation ($8.1 million after-tax).</p>
<p>				     Full Year December 31,</p>
<p>					1996	    1995</p>
<p> Net sales		     $2,065.0(1)    $1,863.2</p>
