<p>  consolidation charges	    --	    20.1(4)</p>
<p>Total operating costs and</p>
<p>  expenses			1,862.7	 1,682.5</p>
<p> Operating earnings	     202.3	   180.7</p>
<p> Interest expense, net	   21.5	    24.3</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes 180.8	   156.4</p>
<p> Income taxes			89.0	    56.3</p>
<p>Earnings from continuing</p>
<p>  operations			 91.8	   100.1</p>
