<p> Average common shrs outstanding  49.7	49.2</p>
<p>Note: (1) Includes $4.2 of royalty income.</p>
<p>(2) Includes charges of $13.0 in cost of sales and $4.9 in selling, general and administrative expenses for product warranty costs, asset valuations, plant closures, environmental costs and insurance gain on the recovery of destroyed assets.  </p>
<p>(3) Represents pre-tax gain on sale of Kinney Vacuum.</p>
<p>(4) Includes $7.4 million of before-tax charges ($4.8 million after tax or $0.10 per share) for acquisition of Best Power Technology, Inc and $12.7 million of before-tax charges ($8.1 million after tax or $0.17 per share) related to the merger with Data Switch Corporation.</p>
<p>(5) Represents additional anticipated losses booked in the second and third quarters related to the disposal of Leeds &amp; Northrup and Dynapower/Stratopower, which were accounted for as discontinued operations since the fourth quarter of 1994.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
